{"3879300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GAIONIN WAR don't combine", "steam_appid": 3879300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3879710], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*As previously announced, the online service for this game will operate for approximately one year from the release date.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will be shutting down the game’s online servers in August 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From 1 September, even users who own the game in their library will be unable to access the servers following an update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who purchased the game at the very last minute will be eligible for a standard refund.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879300/extras/1cf394ac9a76edaea37bf5989fbb8a57.avif?t=1788263722\" width=720 height=120 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game is a new online FPS with a unique rule called “Shop And War.”</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > with the help of overseas experts on firearms, he has created a game based on MFPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players battle in online mode with up to 5 vs. 5 players and compete for points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are shops on the battlefield, and players can also participate as merchants of death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who become merchants have the potential to earn more points than those who kill on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, this is a battlefield, and merchants are also caught in the crossfire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soldiers can kill merchants to disrupt their business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By protecting merchants while advancing on the battlefield, you can gain an advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a certain country at war, and even near the combat zone, many civilians still reside in the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They have no place to flee, and continue to visit the market in search of dark merchants to sustain their livelihoods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win the war, you need not only a micro perspective of military victory but also a macro perspective of the wartime economy.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879300/extras/069d20092146ed13fbdb514c78431055.avif?t=1788263722\" width=720 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >We pioneered a new genre: shooter + career simulator.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While this game may appear at first glance to be a composite homage to established genres,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >it is built upon a new, confident PvP system requiring exceptionally balanced tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first glance, these two seemingly incompatible genres are not unrealistic at all; in fact, they seem to embody the reality of actual warfare more than conventional FPS games ever could.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879300/extras/ae7b9eb7f8514963f1a490a81b177729.avif?t=1788263722\" width=720 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FPS gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many players move in the same way as in a normal online FPS.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the battlefield and find money to use as capital for trade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemy merchants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect merchants.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879300/extras/b4dfdce5fbfa0ca16f09fe7538f27ec2.avif?t=1788263722\" width=720 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“It's precisely because it's wartime that I want to buy things.”</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who play as merchants first seek out black market middlemen and procure goods, registers, and shelves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no damage effects for civilian customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The price of goods multiplied by a certain factor is added to the team's score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If merchants function effectively, they can earn more points than soldiers can by making kills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879300/extras/529fe8b4fcd2b5a7bc6075114054d44b.avif?t=1788263722\" width=720 height=120 /></span>customize your okyo Sutras!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a soldier dies, a funeral is held</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the funeral, a chant plays for up to 30 seconds, but up to four QTE inputs are required. By correctly inputting the QTE, you can respawn quickly and skip the okyo Sutras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879300/extras/c54890bc1e024aa4da1c05eaf8268076.avif?t=1788263722\" width=720 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless Suppression: Slam missiles into the store!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down the staff with missiles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(No damage will be inflicted on customers or civilians)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※This game is an online game, but even when there are few players available, you can freely include bots in matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play PvP matches, matches against bots, bot-only matches, and unmanned matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※Registering an a free online ID is required during the game, but please do not register your email address or real name. We do not collect personal information. Use any string of characters for your sign-in ID, nickname, and password.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※The sutra audio used in this work is not intended to recreate actual religious rituals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a shortened, edited version of the sutra text for dramatic effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not intended to convey religious meaning or efficacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is provided solely to allow you to experience, through sound, the atmosphere and cultural impression found in Japanese funerals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please understand this in advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*As previously announced, the online service for this game will operate for approximately one year from the release date.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will be shutting down the game’s online servers in August 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From 1 September, even users who own the game in their library will be unable to access the servers following an update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who purchased the game at the very last minute will be eligible for a standard refund.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat