pon a new, confident PvP system requiring exceptionally balanced tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first glance, these two seemingly incompatible genres are not unrealistic at all; in fact, they seem to embody the reality of actual warfare more than conventional FPS games ever could.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879300/extras/ae7b9eb7f8514963f1a490a81b177729.avif?t=1788263722\" width=720 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FPS gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many players move in the same way as in a normal online FPS.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the battlefield and find money to use as capital for trade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemy merchants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect merchants.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879300/extras/b4dfdce5fbfa0ca16f09fe7538f27ec2.avif?t=1788263722\" width=720 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“It's precisely because it's wartime that I want to buy things.”</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who play as merchants first seek out black market middlemen and procure goods, registers, and shelves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no damage effects for civilian customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The price of goods multiplied by a certain factor is added to the team's score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If merchants function effectively, they can earn more points than soldiers can by making kills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragrap