 to convey religious meaning or efficacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is provided solely to allow you to experience, through sound, the atmosphere and cultural impression found in Japanese funerals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please understand this in advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "This game is a new online FPS with a unique rule called “Shop And War.” The objective is to compete for points. There are shops on the battlefield, and players can also participate as merchants of death. Players who become merchants earn more points than those who kill on the battlefield.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Traditional Chinese, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879300/7e486713d3e284e72fbfc3e2021e25c89ee3ae32/header.jpg?t=1788263722", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879300/43e21af6949925e32d452f2304aca6089f3de0a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788263722", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879300/43e21af6949925e32d452f2304aca6089f3de0a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788263722", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> core i3 (room master will need additional costs)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8GB VRAM card<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 19 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> core i7-4790 (room master will need addi